    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26广东）未来五年，某市计划新增风电装机容量占新能源总装机容量的40%，光伏装机容量占新能源总装机容量的35%，其余为生物质能，已知光伏装机容量比生物质能多120兆瓦，则未来五年，该市新能源总装机容量为（）兆瓦。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "600"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "800"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1000"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1200"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          12
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          6
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-01-p012.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（一） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第6页",
            "pdfPage": 12
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先找120兆瓦对应的比例差。生物质能占1-40%-35%=25%，光伏比它多35%-25%=10%，这10%才对应120兆瓦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "总装机容量=\\frac{120}{35\\%-25\\%}=1200\\text{兆瓦}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "核验：风电480、光伏420、生物质能300，光伏确实多120，所以选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "部分的实际差量，要对应部分占比之差。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
