    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（24联考）运动会招募志愿者，第一次招募了不到100人，其中男女比例为11：7；补招若干女性志愿者后，男女比例变为4：3。问最多可能补招了多少名女性志愿者？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "5"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "6"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "10"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
