    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26广东）某蓄电池可以同时供20台设备运行5天，在供20台设备运行12小时后，又新增了5台设备。如果所有设备每天的耗电量相等，则该蓄电池还可以供这些设备运行（）天。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3.6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3.8"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4.0"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          12
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          6
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s01-t02-mother-03-p012.webp",
